              "id": "ex-0684-2",
              "style": "written",
              "register": "plain_written",
              "hanzi": "公司明天上午有会议。",
              "pinyin": "gōngsī míngtiān shàngwǔ yǒu huìyì.",
              "english": "The company has a meeting tomorrow morning.",
              "teaching_note": "Simple descriptive or narrative use of 会议."
